        {
          "text": "“Ögoote gonsui garë ngöteebhiri. Ötagaacha götara ninyoora hake amariina gi ichinooköë chindë; gayö ganga kuigubhua gukurua kumunyua gooo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.13",
